The images in docs/images/ illustrate the README and the docs bundle. The
GIFs record.gif and typing.gif are recorded by prec from this repository's own
shots (render/terminal.toml's record and examples/demo's typing) and made GIFs
by pconv, under the MIT licence like the code. The stills are
prec renders of examples/demo's palette shot: themes.png (six themes from one
recording), frame.png (window and bare) and sizes.png (a crop of the 720p and
2160p stills), laid out with ImageMagick. The charts frames-vs-vhs.png and
rerender.png are drawn by pito-compare (pcmp) from docs/bench/*.toml, with
numbers measured by docs/bench/bench.sh against VHS v0.11.0. All are under the
MIT licence like the code.

The PITO MD wordmark docs/images/pitomd-wordmark.svg, shown at the README's
Licence section, is copied by bin/marks from the PITO MD brand masters
(exports/pitomd/readme/wordmark.svg) at aa3aee8b232a1b848995bf3d9a012a01d4aff8ec.

